    "label": "54",
    "prompt": "Factorise the following.\n$$x^2-xy-12y^2$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x-4y)(x+3y)$",
      "worked": "The cross terms are $-4xy+3xy=-xy$, and $(-4y)(3y)=-12y^2$.\n$$x^2-xy-12y^2=(x-4y)(x+3y).$$",
